    obtain ⟨μ, hμ⟩ := GlobalTheory.T.doubledWeil_split_place_vacuum_eigenfunction F E σ B a a' G X om om' hT v hs hv hψ dd omd hdc hsp r hr w₀ hw₀
    have hinv : μ • omd w₀⁻¹ S = S := by
